{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1790237255","published":"2026-09-24T08:07:46Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:12.292481126Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-7210"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-7210","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: insufficient entropy in the expat hash salt\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-7210.patch: append a dedicated 16-byte\n       expat_hashsalt16 field to _Py_HashSecret_t in Include/object.h, which\n       _PyRandom_Init() seeds along with the rest of the secret, and pass it\n       to libexpat through XML_SetHashSalt16Bytes() in Modules/pyexpat.c and\n       Modules/_elementtree.c when that symbol is available, so the SipHash\n       key libexpat derives is 128 bits instead of the 32 or 64 bits the\n       legacy XML_SetHashSalt() could carry\n     - debian/control, debian/control.in: libpython2.7-stdlib now depends on\n       libexpat1 (>= 2.2.10-2+deb11u7+tuxcare.els3), the first libexpat on\n       this platform to export XML_SetHashSalt16Bytes\n     - CVE-2026-7210","affected":[{"package":{"name":"idle-python2.7","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/idle-python2.7?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.7.18-8+deb11u1+tuxcare.els4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1790237255.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython2.7","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython2.7?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.7.18-8+deb11u1+tuxcare.els4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1790237255.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython2.7-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython2.7-dev?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.7.18-8+deb11u1+tuxcare.els4"}]}],"database_specif